+    /// Curved arrow (the Arrow tool): a smooth curve through `points` (start first, head last),
+    /// `widths` one per point (px). `head`: 0 triangle, 1 barbed, 2 open, 3 none; `tail`: 0 flat,
+    /// 1 pointed, 2 arrowhead. Roundings are percentages (0..=100).
+    CurveArrow {
